	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "On considère l'arbre pondéré ci-dessous.\n\n```probtree\nA:0.{{a}}\n  B:0.{{b}}\n  \\overline{B}:0.{{eval:10-b}}\n\\overline{A}:0.{{eval:10-a}}\n  B:0.{{c}}\n  \\overline{B}:0.{{eval:10-c}}\n```\n\nDonne le résultat en fraction irréductible.\n\n$P_B(A)=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "1..9"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["b != c"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:a*b/(a*b+(10-a)*c)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Par définition, $P_B(A)=\\dfrac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}$. L'arbre donne $P_A(B)$, pas $P_B(A)$.",
					"$P(A\\cap B)=0.{{a}}\\times0.{{b}}={{eval:a*b/100}}$ et $P(\\overline{A}\\cap B)=0.{{eval:10-a}}\\times0.{{c}}={{eval:(10-a)*c/100}}$, donc $P(B)={{eval:(a*b+(10-a)*c)/100}}$.",
					"$P_B(A)={{eval:a*b/100}}\\div{{eval:(a*b+(10-a)*c)/100}}={{eval:a*b/(a*b+(10-a)*c)}}$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "On considère l'arbre pondéré ci-dessous.\n\n```probtree\nA:0.{{a}}\n  B:0.{{b}}\n  \\overline{B}:0.{{eval:10-b}}\n\\overline{A}:0.{{eval:10-a}}\n  B:0.{{c}}\n  \\overline{B}:0.{{eval:10-c}}\n```\n\nDonne le résultat en fraction irréductible.\n\n$P_{\\overline{B}}(\\overline{A})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "1..9"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["b != c"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(10-a)*(10-c)/(a*(10-b)+(10-a)*(10-c))}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Par définition, $P_{\\overline{B}}(\\overline{A})=\\dfrac{P(\\overline{A}\\cap \\overline{B})}{P(\\overline{B})}$. L'arbre donne $P_{\\overline{A}}(\\overline{B})$, pas $P_{\\overline{B}}(\\overline{A})$.",
					"$P(A\\cap \\overline{B})=0.{{a}}\\times0.{{eval:10-b}}={{eval:a*(10-b)/100}}$ et $P(\\overline{A}\\cap \\overline{B})=0.{{eval:10-a}}\\times0.{{eval:10-c}}={{eval:(10-a)*(10-c)/100}}$, donc $P(\\overline{B})={{eval:(a*(10-b)+(10-a)*(10-c))/100}}$.",
					"$P_{\\overline{B}}(\\overline{A})={{eval:(10-a)*(10-c)/100}}\\div{{eval:(a*(10-b)+(10-a)*(10-c))/100}}={{eval:(10-a)*(10-c)/(a*(10-b)+(10-a)*(10-c))}}$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "On considère l'arbre pondéré ci-dessous.\n\n```probtree\nA:{{n}}/{{d}}\n  B:{{r}}/{{s}}\n  \\overline{B}:{{eval:s-r}}/{{s}}\n\\overline{A}:{{eval:d-n}}/{{d}}\n  B:{{m}}/{{q}}\n  \\overline{B}:{{eval:q-m}}/{{q}}\n```\n\nDonne le résultat en fraction irréductible.\n\n$P_B(A)=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "3..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "3..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "eval:s"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"n < d",
				"gcd(n, d) = 1",
				"r < s",
				"gcd(r, s) = 1",
				"m < s",
				"gcd(m, s) = 1",
				"r != m"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(n*r/(d*s))/(n*r/(d*s)+(d-n)*m/(d*q))}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Par définition, $P_B(A)=\\dfrac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}$. L'arbre donne $P_A(B)$, pas $P_B(A)$.",
					"$P(A\\cap B)=\\dfrac{ {{n}} }{ {{d}} }\\times\\dfrac{ {{r}} }{ {{s}} }={{eval:n*r/(d*s)}}$ et $P(\\overline{A}\\cap B)=\\dfrac{ {{eval:d-n}} }{ {{d}} }\\times\\dfrac{ {{m}} }{ {{q}} }={{eval:(d-n)*m/(d*q)}}$, donc $P(B)={{eval:n*r/(d*s)+(d-n)*m/(d*q)}}$.",
					"$P_B(A)={{eval:n*r/(d*s)}}\\div{{eval:n*r/(d*s)+(d-n)*m/(d*q)}}={{eval:(n*r/(d*s))/(n*r/(d*s)+(d-n)*m/(d*q))}}$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
